{"song": "Kinematic_-_Peyote", "config": "chunk60", "model": "models/asr", "seconds": 183.373375, "maxNewTokens": 608, "elapsed": 271.1638367176056, "exit": 0, "chunks": [{"index": 0, "offset": 0.0, "length": 64.5, "raw": "\"I'm asleep at the wheel and there's a car in the highway. Yet we tear through the night like a bee out of my brain. How much pain is it aching so exquisite? I hope we can stop it. So now you don't want to dance, but you're looking right through you. Oh, and the clothes that you wear, we don't need to stand.\""}, {"index": 2, "offset": 123.6, "length": 59.77, "raw": "\"Oh, doesn't you bother us? We don't really care. And that's quite enough of that.\""}, {"index": 1, "offset": 64.5, "length": 59.1, "raw": "\"Now the sky is on fire and the desert is freezing. Wonder how I'm alive when I'm not even breathing. How much pain there is—it's aching so exquisite. I hope we can stop in time. Now you don't wanna dance 'cause they're looking right through you. Oh, and the clothes that you wear don't make you stand. Oh, but the people you know just say what they want to.\""}], "result": {"language": "English", "text": "I'm asleep at the wheel and there's a car in the highway. Yet we tear through the night like a bee out of my brain. How much pain is it aching so exquisite? I hope we can stop it. So now you don't want to dance, but you're looking right through you. Oh, and the clothes that you wear, we don't need to stand.Now the sky is on fire and the desert is freezing. Wonder how I'm alive when I'm not even breathing. How much pain there is—it's aching so exquisite. I hope we can stop in time. Now you don't wanna dance 'cause they're looking right through you. Oh, and the clothes that you wear don't make you stand. Oh, but the people you know just say what they want to.Oh, doesn't you bother us? We don't really care. And that's quite enough of that.", "timestamps": {"items": [{"end_time": 20.96, "start_time": 0.16, "text": "I'm"}, {"end_time": 23.44, "star